# Mini-NARS Sample Experience: Animal Taxonomy
# Based on the example in Chapter 4 of "Designing a Mind"

# Input some initial knowledge
<bird --> animal>. %1.0;0.9%
<robin --> bird>. %1.0;0.9%

# Run 5 inference cycles to process
5

# Now ask a question: can the system derive robin -> animal?
<robin --> animal>?

# Run more cycles to find the answer
20

# More knowledge
<fish --> animal>. %1.0;0.9%
<salmon --> fish>. %1.0;0.9%
<penguin --> bird>. %1.0;0.9%
<penguin --> swimmer>. %1.0;0.9%

10

# Query
<salmon --> animal>?
20
